ive.org/web/20131130031853/http://mff.se/Aktuellt/Nyheter/2013-11-27_avsked\">https://web.archive.org/web/20131130031853/http://mff.se/Aktuellt/Nyheter/2013-11-27_avsked</a></span><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">.&#32;Läst 10 december 2013</span>.</cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.btitle=Rikard+Norling+s%C3%A4ger+upp+sig+fr%C3%A5n+MFF&amp;rft.atitle=&amp;rft.date=27+november+2013&amp;rft.pub=Malm%C3%B6+FF&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fweb.archive.org%2Fweb%2F20131130031853%2Fhttp%3A%2F%2Fmff.se%2FAktuellt%2FNyheter%2F2013-11-27&#95;avsked&amp;rfr&#95;id=info:sid/en.wikipedia.org:Fotbollsallsvenskan&#95;2013\"><span style=\"display: none;\">&#160;</span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Syrianska&#95;Manager-22\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-Syrianska_Manager_22-0\">^</a> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r58662249\" /><cite style=\"font-style:normal\" class=\"web\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20131213061804/http://www.syrianskafc.com/Default/tabid/61/Id/3a193e01-c979-4dc8-9839-3df529904568/Seger-for-Ozcan-Syrianska-i-sista-hemmamatchen-i-allsvenskan.aspx\">”Seger för Özcan &amp; Syrianska i sista hemmamatchen i allsvenskan”</a>. Syrianska FC. 1 november 2013. Arkiverad från <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.syrianskafc.com/Default/tabid/61/Id/3a193e01-c979-4dc8-9839-3df529904568/Seger-for-Ozcan-Syrianska-i-sista-hemmamatchen-i-allsvenskan.aspx\">originalet</a>&#32;den 13 december 2013<span class=\"printonly\">. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20131213061804/http://www.syrianskafc.com/Default/tabid/61/Id/3a193e01-c979-4dc8-9839-3df529904568/Seger-for-Ozcan-Syrianska-i-sista-hemmamatchen-i-allsvenskan.aspx\">https://web.archive.org/web/20131213061804/htt